<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Congratulations on Your Enrollment!</title>
  <style>
    /* Global Styles */
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #000;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #111;
      width: 100%;
    }

    header .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #f00;
    }

    header nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    header nav a {
      color: #e06565;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    header .logout {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    header .logout-button {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background-color: #007bff;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    header .logout-button:hover {
      background-color: #0056b3;
    }

    main {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #f00;
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .enrollment-card {
      background-color: #111;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0px 0px 15px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.5);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    button {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #f00;
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }

    button:hover {
      background-color: #b30000;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Artender</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/explorecompetitions">Explore works</a>
      <a href="/competitions">Participate in Competitions</a>
      <a href="#">Contact</a>
      <a href="/profile">Profile</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="logout">
      <form action="/logout" method="get">
        <button class="logout-button" type="submit">Logout</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="enrollment-card">
      <h1>Congratulations!</h1>
      <p>You have successfully enrolled in the contest. We are thrilled to have you as a participant and can't wait to see your creative work showcased in this competition.</p>
      <p>Keep an eye on your email and our announcements page for important updates. We wish you the very best and hope your journey through this contest is inspiring and rewarding!</p>
      
      <form action="/completeEnrollment/{{contest.contestId}}" method="POST">
        <button type="submit">Complete Enrollment</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
